<p><b>Do this.</b> Fix the clock at ingestion. Retrain on a rolling, time-ordered schedule and keep a rule for unlabelled attack types. Move infiltration detection to host and session level: flow features carry no signal for {{ n.t7_allatk_dup }} of it.</p>
